1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,060
 The reason you still can't create a viral edit comes down to one thing and one thing only.

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:09,280
 It's not because you don't have a special course and it's not because you can't do it.

3
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,900
 The information's available everywhere.

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:11,740
 Look around you.

5
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:14,200
 How many professional video editors do you see?

6
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,660
 None of them were born this way and none of them had it easier than you.

7
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:22,540
 The only difference is that they were willing to put in the work even when they didn't feel like it.

8
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:27,340
 The problem I see with most editors today is honestly they're just not willing to work hard enough.

9
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:30,340
 Success is a combination of knowledge and hard work.

10
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:33,580
 You need to know what to do and you need to go and actually do it.

11
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:38,580
 There are hundreds of editing tutorials for you to watch and there's so many courses for you to invest in.

12
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:41,300
 You just haven't sat down and actually done it.

13
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:42,620
 So this is your reminder.

14
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:47,100
 Don't let this be another day that passes without you getting one step closer to your goal.

